            <ArticleTitle>Investigation and management of the painful hip in childhood.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>270-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The cause of the painful hip in childhood must be identified quickly to avoid permanent damage resulting from conditions such as septic arthritis. A painful hip may be the presenting feature of a number of conditions and their investigation and management are described here.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
